## 2026-08-10 — Self-service signup does not verify email ownership
**Status:** OPEN (accepted risk for the Aug 14 handoff)
**Severity:** Low
**Area:** `src/features/producer-access/`

Anyone can register with an address they do not control. Acceptable because registration grants
no capability — the account is `public` until an administrator approves producer access, and a
human reviews every request. Worth closing before the platform is promoted publicly, since
decision emails are sent to an unverified address.

