## 2026-08-10 — 405 imported festivals are unpublished; the public site is empty
**Status:** OPEN (deliberate, operator decision)
**Severity:** Informational
**Area:** data

All 405 imported festivals were moved `published → unpublished` on request. Only `published`
festivals are publicly discoverable, so search, the calendar, the map, and imported festival
detail pages currently return nothing.

Reversing is one transition each. Note that `festival-publish-batch.mjs` deliberately excludes
`unpublished` from `PUBLISHABLE_FROM` so a festival taken down on purpose is not silently
republished by a bulk job — restoring all 405 needs that guard relaxed or an explicit
`--include-unpublished` flag.

