## 2026-08-10 — Imported festivals have no imagery and no descriptions
**Status:** DEFERRED (needs client decision)
**Severity:** Low
**Area:** data / importer

Of 405 published festivals, zero have `image_url`, `logo_url`, or an Instagram handle. 267 have a
website URL, which is the only usable source. Pulling imagery would mean crawling 267 third-party
sites for Open Graph images, with copyright questions about republishing and a storage decision
(Vercel's filesystem is not durable). Text search matches only name, location, and mapped
category as a result. Branded placeholders cover the gap for now.
